  "snapshot_segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "source": "ao_r16",
      "start": 164.8,
      "end": 175.2,
      "narration": "到了澳网，她在第四轮输给高芙。扳回一盘，仍然没能继续向前。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "source": "doha",
      "start": 238.1,
      "end": 248.7,
      "narration": "二月的这场决赛，她又走到了最后。对面，是姆博科。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "source": "doha",
      "start": 250.0,
      "end": 264.3,
      "narration": "",
      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 7.64,
          "end": 10.36,
          "text": "It's Muchova's magical night.\n这是属于穆霍娃的梦幻之夜。"
        },
        {
          "at": 11.5,
          "end": 13.82,
          "text": "The trophy drought is over.\n冠军荒结束了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "source": "doha_trophy",
      "start": 3.0,
      "end": 9.5,
      "narration": "六年半后再次捧杯，也是她的第一座千分冠。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "source": "miami",
      "start": 195.0,
      "end": 206.5,
      "narration": "印第安韦尔斯止步第四轮后，她在迈阿密再次战胜姆博科，打进半决赛。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "source": "miami",
      "start": 223.4,
      "end": 237.8,
      "narration": "",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "source": "stuttgart_final",
      "start": 252.1,
      "end": 260.5,
      "narration": "换到红土，穆霍娃又打进了斯图加特决赛。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "source": "stuttgart_final",
      "start": 261,
      "end": 271.4,
      "narration": "她最后不敌莱巴金娜，收获亚军。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "source": "bad_homburg",
      "start": 462.8,
      "end": 471.2,
      "narration": "柏林止步第二轮后，她在巴特洪堡迎来决赛。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "source": "bad_homburg",
      "start": 471.2,
      "end": 480.0,
      "narration": "六比一、一比零，大坂因脚伤退赛。穆霍娃拿到首个草地巡回赛单打冠军。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "source": "bad_homburg",
      "start": 494.0,
      "end": 500.4,
      "narration": "",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "source": "bad_homburg_feature",
      "start": 141.1,
      "end": 146.1,
      "narration": "",
      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 0.16,
          "end": 4.88,
          "text": "Definitely gives me some confidence to have these good matches under the belt.\n这些高质量的比赛，确实给了我一些信心。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "source": "wimbledon_sf",
      "start": 606.5,
      "end": 634.5,
      "narration": "",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "source": "wimbledon_sf_interview",
      "start": 53.94,
      "end": 61.4,
      "narration": "",
      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 0.1,
          "end": 7.32,
          "text": "I'm really kind of shaking and trying to sink it in, but the atmosphere here, undescribable.\n我真的还有些发抖，想慢慢消化这一切。这里的氛围，难以形容。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "source": "wimbledon_final",
      "start": 206.6,
      "end": 214.8,
      "narration": "决赛三盘失利。温网亚军的一千三百分，是她本季最大的一笔单打积分。",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "source": "wimbledon_final",
      "start": 214.8,
      "end": 225.0,
      "narration": "",
      "quote": null
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "source": "uso_r32",
      "start": 179.5,
      "end": 190.7,
      "narration": "回到美网单打，她前两轮只丢四局，第三轮却输给纳瓦罗。",
      "quote": null
    }
  ],
